    "sha256": "c1106f3cfb5508f4e6449d8af9ae82b64419d7f7b3f4118205add1b3cfe387ad",
    "k": 28,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 3,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Yeah. If we continue to see the ice melt speeding up, and don’t cut back on our climate pollution emissions, ",
    "zh": "是的。如果冰融化继续加速，而我们又不减少气候污染物的排放，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "cut back on",
      "emission"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen034.png",
    "sha256": "7af8921751d2db9ad527eb8d0f01a590635daa6c7c1f9433e66e2e8f7be10c23",
    "k": 28,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 3,
    "role": null,
    "en": "then we’re pointed more towards six feet, possibly, rather than the three feet predicted by 2100, ",
    "zh": "那么到2100年，海平面上升可能会更接近6英尺，而不是预测的3英尺；",
    "vocabulary": [
      "predict"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen035.png",
    "sha256": "11272050efbe3f18cf69727798bc72a1cf7f91f1f2ae75bb32479326f6eb1d62",
    "k": 28,
    "part": 3,
    "parts": 3,
    "role": null,
    "en": "and that will be unmanageable in very many places.",
    "zh": "这对许多地方来说将难以应对。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "unmanageable"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen036.png",
    "sha256": "5d52e29bb6e534fe473b54d3ef0a52172ba5b0517f16240028dbeacc76eac0d3",
    "k": 29,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Also the effects that we’re seeing of sea level rise, of climate change in a global capacity.",
    "zh": "还有，我们正在看到的海平面上升、全球范围气候变化的这些影响。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "in a global capacity"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen037.png",
    "sha256": "f906c2665723f7b53a408c5277c0485854efdd5d4691430d4ef7517580e70888",
    "k": 30,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "This is because of the carbon that we’ve already put into the atmosphere, not just exactly what we’re doing today.",
    "zh": "这些是由我们此前已经排入大气的碳造成的，并不只是今天正在进行的排放所致。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "carbon",
      "atmosphere"
    ]
  },
