    "file": "screen038.png",
    "sha256": "d349bf8b6ef85e3cf0cf537377dc9bb03413d1a33b342eb16545ce69a1ccef67",
    "k": 31,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "So even if everyone stopped driving, all the factories shut down, and somehow we didn’t produce CO2, ",
    "zh": "所以，即使每个人都停止开车，所有工厂都关闭，而且我们设法不再产生二氧化碳，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "shut down",
      "CO2"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen039.png",
    "sha256": "012a4e9839b6b749fd663052cee8dfcd359debe86c58fefcff05bd67e9c48b7b",
    "k": 31,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "we’re still going to see the effects of climate change.",
    "zh": "气候变化的影响仍会持续出现。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "climate change"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen040.png",
