    "k": 32,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Yes, we are. Unfortunately, once the carbon is in the atmosphere, most of it stays for hundreds and thousands of years.",
    "zh": "是的，确实如此。遗憾的是，碳一旦进入大气，大部分就会在那里停留数百年乃至数千年。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "unfortunately",
      "atmosphere"
    ]
  },
