    "k": 33,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "But if we do something to control our pollution NOW, we can really slow it down a lot and make it more manageable, and that’s the name of the game, really.",
    "zh": "但如果我们现在就采取措施控制污染，就能大幅减缓变化，使其更容易应对；说到底，这才是关键。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "manageable",
      "the name of the game"
    ]
  },
